- No charge.

01:41.197 --> 01:43.154
- I do not want it.
- But it's free, sir.

01:43.238 --> 01:46.180
<i>If that DVD even touches
Road House, I will kill you.</i>

01:47.472 --> 01:48.474
Don't worry.

01:48.557 --> 01:51.943
