They don't know what they're talking about.

13:55.183 --> 13:56.922
You're an amazing woman.

13:57.205 --> 13:59.109
Oh, you're just saying that.

13:59.192 --> 14:00.237
No, I'm not.

14:00.667 --> 14:03.401
